 # Theme tokens in React stylesheets
 
+The React UI reads tokens from two sources. **New and migrated controls** read the `--tl-*` tokens and
+the `tl-` classes of the design-system package - see [the design-system package](doc:view-layer/design-system)
+before writing CSS for them. **Controls not migrated yet** still read the theme tokens described here;
+they leave this article with their block in `tlReactControls.css`. The cascade layers, the colouring
+of values by role and the audit test below apply to both.
+
